@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8F9FA

title BudgetLite - End-to-End System Flow (100% Release)

actor "User" as User
participant "App UI" as UI
participant "BiometricGuard" as Bio
participant "TxnNotifier" as Txn
database "Drift DB" as DB
participant "PdfGen" as PDF
participant "Printing" as Print

== 1. App Launch & Biometric Unlock ==
User -> UI : Open BudgetLite
UI -> Bio : Verify Hardware Sensor
Bio --> UI : Authenticated -> Show Dashboard

== 2. Live Ledger & Stream Ingestion ==
User -> UI : Log Split Txn / Scan SMS
UI -> Txn : splitTxn() / scanSms()
Txn -> DB : Atomic SQLite Insert / Migration
DB --> UI : Push reactive Stream update

== 3. Financial Statements & Export ==
User -> UI : Select Date Range & "Export PDF"
UI -> PDF : generateReportPdf(data)
PDF -> PDF : Compile A4 MultiPage Document
PDF --> UI : Uint8List PDF bytes
UI -> Print : sharePdf(bytes, filename)
Print -> User : Open Android Share / Print Sheet

@enduml
